## Usage

Every tile is a live, interactive component. Drag the cards or click the title in the top-left corner to open full demos and API docs.

::DocsComponentsGallery{suite="flow"}
::

### Common orchestration patterns

| Scenario | Recommended setup | Demo |
|---|---|---|
| Rule engine & triggers | Vertical `bezier` + custom `#node` slot + grid snap | [Basic workflow](/en/flowchart#basic-workflow) |
| Edge routing & fallback | Multi-tone connectors + signal `pulse` + midpoint labels | [Edge curves & effects](/en/flowchart#edge-curves-markers-canvas-patterns-and-effects) |
| CI/CD release pipeline | `direction="horizontal"` + node `status` rings + parallel lanes | [Horizontal pipeline](/en/flowchart#horizontal-pipeline--live-run-states) |
| AI Agent multi-tool DAG | Fan-out/converge graph + selection inspector + `fitView()` | [AI Agent orchestration](/en/flowchart#ai-agent-multi-branch-orchestration) |
| Risk approval state machine | `edgeType="smoothstep"` + `background="lines"` + branch labels | [Orthogonal approval flow](/en/flowchart#orthogonal-approval--fallback-state-machine) |
| Full automation studio | Canvas + node inspector + run history + live log split | [Automation template](/en/template-automation) |

## Overview

The Flow suite turns multi-step automations, release pipelines and AI agent tool chains into readable, draggable and observable diagrams. **Flowchart** provides the controlled canvas primitive: dotted/lined/cross backdrops, vertical or horizontal flow axes, `bezier` / `smoothstep` / `straight` routing, directional markers and luminous signal pulses, node execution status halos, alignment snap guides, and pan/zoom controls with a live minimap. Import from `@talex-touch/tuffex/flowchart` or `@talex-touch/tuffex/ai`.
